                                                "sense_id": "04b3cb3a-400f-3847-9850-677c1fcb72f9",
                                                "text": "The theory that Balinese religion was a branch of Indian Hinduism led the society to believe that the literature of ancient Bali should be in the classical language of India, but in fact the Kawi language has absolutely no grammatical connection to Sanskrit."
                                            }
